From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 19:50:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] bump pyo3 to 0.30 for cp314t

The riscv64 manylinux image ships no cp313t interpreter (gotcha 11), so the
free-threaded leg of this build targets cp314t instead of upstream's own
cp313t (see upstream's .github/workflows/CI.yml, which only ever builds and
tests against 3.13t). pyo3 0.23.5 enforces a hard ceiling in
pyo3-build-config: "the configured Python interpreter version (3.14) is newer
than PyO3's maximum supported version (3.13)", and the free-threaded build of
CPython has no limited-API fallback to dodge it with, so the cp314t leg fails
to compile outright, on any architecture, before riscv64 is even reached.

pyo3 0.30.1 raises that ceiling to 3.15 and fully supports Python 3.14's
free-threaded build. Bumping the dependency version is the only change
needed: this crate's own pyo3 usage (#[pyclass]/#[pymethods] over
Bound<'_, PyAny>, no raw C API calls) is already written against the modern
Bound-based API pyo3 0.21+ introduced and needs no source changes. pyo3 0.30
also dropped the `abi3-py38` feature (its own floor moved to Python 3.9), so
the `gil-abi3` feature's reference to it has to move to `abi3-py39` in the
same patch or cargo's own feature-graph validation fails before reaching the
ceiling check at all; this is harmless for the abi3 leg, which already
builds on cp39 as the oldest interpreter in the riscv64 image (gotcha 96).

Verified locally: `cargo build --release --no-default-features` (the
cp314t leg's own `MATURIN_PEP517_ARGS`) and `cargo build --release --features
gil-abi3` (the abi3 leg's default) both compile clean against pyo3 0.30.1,
with only pre-existing `fetch_update`-is-now-`try_update` deprecation
warnings from the `portable-atomic` dependency, no errors.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [our riscv64 image's missing cp313t interpreter forces this build onto cp314t, which upstream's own CI never builds or tests against]
---
 Cargo.toml | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Cargo.toml b/Cargo.toml
index b5ea86d..6560b42 100644
--- a/Cargo.toml
+++ b/Cargo.toml
@@ -11,8 +11,8 @@ crate-type = ["cdylib"]
 [dependencies]
 num = "0.4.3"
 portable-atomic = { version = "1.9.0", features = ["std", "float"] }
-pyo3 = { version = "0.23", default-features = false, features = ["extension-module", "macros"] }
+pyo3 = { version = "0.30", default-features = false, features = ["extension-module", "macros"] }

 [features]
 default = ["gil-abi3"]
-gil-abi3 = ["pyo3/abi3", "pyo3/abi3-py38"]
+gil-abi3 = ["pyo3/abi3", "pyo3/abi3-py39"]
